@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#000000 Duration:1.2 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:Transparent SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:1.8

; ========================================
; ＞『娯楽室』を選択
; ========================================

; 写真撮影音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_28 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_11_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Smile1
@AutoSave
[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛，很好哦～<br>哦，侧面角度也棒极了～|#0203Adv07_Miria001| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:40 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Flushed1
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_28 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:我、我说，米莉亚……<br>别拍了，<br>你帮我看看我演得怎样吧……|#0203Adv07_Ema001| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Smile
@Wait WaitMode:0.5

; 写真撮影音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_28 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:为难的表情也好可爱啊～|#0203Adv07_Miria002| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Smile
@Wait WaitMode:0.5
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_28 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:当我进入娱乐室的时候，<br>正好看到米莉亚拿着手机围着艾玛转。|#0203Adv07_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Smile
@Wait WaitMode:0.5
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_28 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:快门声咔嚓咔嚓地不停在房间内回响。|#0203Adv07_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Pensive
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1

; ＠備考◆困惑

[PrintTextModified Text:你们这……是在干什么？|#0203Adv07_Hiro001| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我无法判断是否可以走进房间内，<br>只好站在门口问道。|#0203Adv07_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:啊，希罗……<br>我们这是……|#0203Adv07_Ema002| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛对我的态度<br>有着些许的不知所措。|#0203Adv07_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:可能是因为之前的冲突让她心有余悸。|#0203Adv07_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:在地下的房间里，<br>我跟艾玛依然完全没有交流。<br>这种疏远的关系一直维持至今。|#0203Adv07_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Miria.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:剧本不是已经出来了嘛？虽然就只有开头的一点点。|#0203Adv07_Miria003| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛吞吞吐吐地说不出话来，<br>米莉亚便代她开口，向我说明事情的缘由。|#0203Adv07_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:所以艾玛<br>就来找大叔我来帮忙看看她演得怎样。|#0203Adv07_Miria004| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Pensive

[PrintTextModified Text:……可我看你们也不像是那么回事啊。|#0203Adv07_Hiro002| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:听到我的疑问，米莉亚难为情地笑了笑。|#0203Adv07_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Miria.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:这个嘛……怎么说呢……|#0203Adv07_Miria005| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:米莉亚含糊其辞的模样让我不解。|#0203Adv07_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Miria.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:就在这时候，米莉亚突然露出一副恍然大悟的模样，<br>迅速把手机镜头对准我。|#0203Adv07_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:然后——|#0203Adv07_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; 写真撮影音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_28 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:不知道出于什么想法，她给我拍了一张照。|#0203Adv07_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Miria.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:仔细检查过手机上的画面后，<br>米莉亚满意地点了点头。|#0203Adv07_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:60 IdAndAppearance:Miria
@Wait WaitMode:0.2
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:55 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Smile

[PrintTextModified Text:接着，她把手机递到我面前。|#0203Adv07_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:看，拍得很可爱哦。|#0203Adv07_Miria006| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:手机画面上显示的，是我歪着头，一脸不明所以的照片。|#0203Adv07_Narrative015| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Angry

[PrintTextModified Text:……你这是想干什么？|#0203Adv07_Hiro003| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这种行为着实让人不快。<br>我皱着眉头，用镇静的语气问道。|#0203Adv07_Narrative016| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Miria.Surprised

[PrintTextModified Text:突、突然给你拍照，对不起！<br>最近大叔我有点沉迷摄影嘛。|#0203Adv07_Miria007| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:米莉亚慌忙向我解释道。<br>但她在下一瞬间，却显得有些忧伤。|#0203Adv07_Narrative017| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Miria.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:我们以后会怎样，不是谁都说不准嘛？<br>所以啊……|#0203Adv07_Miria008| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Miria.Angry1

[PrintTextModified Text:大叔我就想着……<br>要把现在的每一个瞬间都记录下来！|#0203Adv07_Miria009| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Miria.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:可是这样突然拍别人确实很没礼貌吧。<br>大叔我就是看着可爱，一下子没忍住……|#0203Adv07_Miria010| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……没错。<br>未经允许擅自拍下照片，<br>被拍的人心里肯定会觉得不舒服。|#0203Adv07_Hiro004| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这种行为还有可能<br>侵害他人肖像权。|#0203Adv07_Hiro005| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:假如你未经本人同意私自将照片公开，<br>也有可能被判定为诽谤或者侵犯个人隐私。|#0203Adv07_Hiro006| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Miria.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:我沉声静气地向米莉亚讲述<br>刑法的相关条文。|#0203Adv07_Narrative018| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:若被认定造成诽谤，<br>将可能判处三年以下的有期徒刑，<br>并处五十万日元以下的罚款。|#0203Adv07_Narrative019| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Miria.Fearful1

[PrintTextModified Text:说到这里，米莉亚已经吓得脸色发白，<br>看着都让我觉得可怜。|#0203Adv07_Narrative020| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Miria.Cry1

[PrintTextModified Text:原来是这样……<br>呜呜……以后我会注意……|#0203Adv07_Miria011| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Miria.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:可是，可是啊，<br>大叔我绝对不会把照片乱上传或者公开哦。|#0203Adv07_Miria012| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这一点我可以对天发誓，<br>不过，大叔我已经知道错了。|#0203Adv07_Miria013| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Pensive_Closed

[PrintTextModified Text:米莉亚低头丧气的，<br>看起来已经在反省。|#0203Adv07_Narrative021| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:说不定没必要担心那么多。<br>也许外面世界的法律对我们来说已经没有意义了。<br>因为，我们早就是笼中鸟、阶下囚。|#0203Adv07_Narrative022| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（话题虽然跑偏了，<br>　但我基本上明白了事情的前因后果）|#0203Adv07_Hiro007|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:在品评艾玛演技如何的过程中，<br>米莉亚受到刚才所说的那股冲动驱使，开始给艾玛拍照。|#0203Adv07_Narrative023| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Miria.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:尽心尽力的艾玛<br>那么的楚楚可怜……|#0203Adv07_Miria014| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:台词说得磕磕巴巴，紧张得动作都不利索。|#0203Adv07_Narrative024| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:反正就是这一切全都戳中了米莉亚的喜好。<br>就像受到某种使命感所驱使一般，她大力主张这一点。|#0203Adv07_Narrative025| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Miria.Angry1

[PrintTextModified Text:那么可爱的样子一定得拍下来才行！|#0203Adv07_Miria015| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Ema.Flushed

[PrintTextModified Text:唔唔……<br>你别这样，太难为情了。|#0203Adv07_Ema003| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛红着脸挤出这句话来。<br>突然，她神色黯淡，垂下头来。|#0203Adv07_Narrative026| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive

[PrintTextModified Text:可是……选我真的好吗。|#0203Adv07_Ema004| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Miria.Surprised

[PrintTextModified Text:欸，你说的哪回事？|#0203Adv07_Miria016| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive

[PrintTextModified Text:我是个外行，演技完全不行，<br>就连背台词，都完全没有自信能做好……|#0203Adv07_Ema005| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我这么没用，却让我出演重要角色，<br>还给我做了这么漂亮的舞台服……|#0203Adv07_Ema006| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Angry1

[PrintTextModified Text:然后呢？<br>难不成你还想说要辞演？|#0203Adv07_Hiro008| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我不由地插嘴道。<br>话语不受我的控制冲口而出。|#0203Adv07_Narrative027| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:除了蕾雅以外，所有人都是外行。<br>就算是这样，大家都斗志昂扬地在努力。<br>一句“没有自信”，你就想擅自一个人放弃？|#0203Adv07_Hiro009| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:我、我没有这个意思！|#0203Adv07_Ema007| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛慌了神似的极力否定。|#0203Adv07_Narrative028| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive

[PrintTextModified Text:我肯定也是想努力的……<br>我只是，觉得心里没底……|#0203Adv07_Ema008| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛垂着眼，声音小得仿佛随时会消散在空气中。|#0203Adv07_Narrative029| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Miria.Pensive

[PrintTextModified Text:欸……那个……|#0203Adv07_Miria017| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]


[PrintTextModified Text:站在我和艾玛之间的米莉亚看起来有点尴尬，<br>眼神游移不定。|#0203Adv07_Narrative030| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:察觉到这一点后，<br>我深深地呼出一口气。|#0203Adv07_Narrative031| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:虽然理智上知道应该怎么做，<br>但心里却仍有某种感情无法释怀。|#0203Adv07_Narrative032| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:为了避免出现更多的牺牲，<br>就算只是表面上也好，<br>我跟艾玛的关系也必须找到一个折中的点才行。|#0203Adv07_Narrative033| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Angry1

[PrintTextModified Text:（我果然还是尽量避免跟艾玛对话为好）<br>|#0203Adv07_Hiro010| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:我无言转身离开了娱乐室。|#0203Adv07_Narrative034| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

